🎯 Most Important Built-In Functional Interfaces
Predicate<T>

Code :
Predicate<Integer> even = n -> n % 2 == 0;

Input  : 10
Output : true

Method : test()



Function<T,R>

Code :
Function<String,Integer> len = String::length;

Input  : "Java"
Output : 4

Method : apply()



Consumer<T>

Code :
Consumer<String> print = System.out::println;

Input  : "Hello"
Output : Hello

Method : accept()



Supplier<T>

Code :
Supplier<String> supplier = () -> "Java";

Input  : No Input
Output : Java

Method : get()



BiFunction<T,U,R>

Code :
